551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (While it is widely argued by some that competition is the best way to live, others might argue that collaboration is the optimal approach in personal and professional lives. Both points of view and reasons why I firmly believe that finding the balance between the two is the most important will be elaborated on in this essay. )
/E (While it is widely argued by some that competition is the best way to live, others might argue that collaboration is the optimal approach in personal and professional lives. Both points of view and reasons why I firmly believe that finding the balance between the two is the most important will be elaborated on in this essay. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
552 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to claim that competition should be encouraged for people in this day and age. To explain it simply, this is because it can foster productivity; therefore, this can be beneficial for companies.  For example, Apple has been encouraging its employees to compete against one another in order to launch the most innovative products to the market. )
/E (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to claim that competition should be encouraged for people in this day and age. To explain it simply, this is because it can foster productivity; therefore, this can be beneficial for companies.  For example, Apple has been encouraging its employees to compete against one another in order to launch the most innovative products to the market. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
553 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (On the other hand, opponents of this idea might propose that collaboration should be prioritized instead of competition. This is due to the fact that cooperative environments can promote better teamwork; thus, this can encourage people to be more motivated to work. Take Microsoft, for instance; employees of this company have been encouraged to collaborate in order to combine their different fields of expertise to create the most groundbreaking products and services.       )
/E (On the other hand, opponents of this idea might propose that collaboration should be prioritized instead of competition. This is due to the fact that cooperative environments can promote better teamwork; thus, this can encourage people to be more motivated to work. Take Microsoft, for instance; employees of this company have been encouraged to collaborate in order to combine their different fields of expertise to create the most groundbreaking products and services.       )
/Pg 23 0 R
>>
endobj
