651 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to believe that a longer working week is better for companies. To explain it simply, this is because this can allow employees to work more; therefore, it can promote increased productivity for corporations/ firms. For example, in 2021, Toyota tried to implement a 4-day work policy, which resulted in decreased productivity and loss of profits. From this perspective, it is logical why some would argue against a shorter working week. )
/E (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to believe that a longer working week is better for companies. To explain it simply, this is because this can allow employees to work more; therefore, it can promote increased productivity for corporations/ firms. For example, in 2021, Toyota tried to implement a 4-day work policy, which resulted in decreased productivity and loss of profits. From this perspective, it is logical why some would argue against a shorter working week. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
652 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (On the other hand, I would personally propose that shorter work hours per week can be beneficial for communities. This is due to the fact that it can enable workers to recharge sufficiently; thus, it can lead to professional satisfaction. For instance, studies in the US in 2021 found that firms that allowed workers to work 4 days per week instead of 5 experienced a 40% increase in efficiency and motivation of employees. In this sense, it is evident that longer weekends can be promising for both corporations and employees in the long run.)
/E (On the other hand, I would personally propose that shorter work hours per week can be beneficial for communities. This is due to the fact that it can enable workers to recharge sufficiently; thus, it can lead to professional satisfaction. For instance, studies in the US in 2021 found that firms that allowed workers to work 4 days per week instead of 5 experienced a 40% increase in efficiency and motivation of employees. In this sense, it is evident that longer weekends can be promising for both corporations and employees in the long run.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
653 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In conclusion, although it is undeniable that a longer work week can bring about more competitiveness for companies in some cases, I am of the opinion that a shorter work week is a sustainable/ excellent solution as it can foster higher balance and satisfaction, which will benefit companies in the long term.      )
/E (In conclusion, although it is undeniable that a longer work week can bring about more competitiveness for companies in some cases, I am of the opinion that a shorter work week is a sustainable/ excellent solution as it can foster higher balance and satisfaction, which will benefit companies in the long term.      )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
