/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (While it is widely argued by some that the availability of international food in supermarkets is a promising development, others might claim that this is detrimental to small businesses, among others. I personally hold the belief that this is negative progress, and my reasons will be elaborated on in this essay.  )
/E (While it is widely argued by some that the availability of international food in supermarkets is a promising development, others might claim that this is detrimental to small businesses, among others. I personally hold the belief that this is negative progress, and my reasons will be elaborated on in this essay.  )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [0]
>>
