/T (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to believe that saving money is not crucial. To explain it simply, this is because they have the belief that money should be used to buy freedom; therefore, it should be utilized for immediate happiness. For example, surveys in 2023 in Bangkok found that 40% of Gen Z spent over half of their spending on travel, which they believed was more important than saving. From this perspective, it is logical why some might argue against excessive saving. )
/E (To begin with, it might seem reasonable for some to believe that saving money is not crucial. To explain it simply, this is because they have the belief that money should be used to buy freedom; therefore, it should be utilized for immediate happiness. For example, surveys in 2023 in Bangkok found that 40% of Gen Z spent over half of their spending on travel, which they believed was more important than saving. From this perspective, it is logical why some might argue against excessive saving. )
